Third-party components
======================

Phase 0 (this repository) vendors no third-party source. Dependencies are
declared in package.json / package-lock.json (npm) and carry their own
licenses (MIT / ISC / Apache-2.0 / BSD-Clause — see `npm ls --omit=dev`).

Guest image components (Debian kernel, Mesa, firmware, userland) are NOT part
of this repository; they enter only via the Phase 1 image build and must be
listed here with their licenses when that lands (ADR-0011: GPL components
stay isolated in the guest image).
